   120	      # hosted runner. Without GH_TOKEN every poll dies on auth, which is
   121	      # BLOCK (fail-closed) — i.e. it would break EVERY release, RC and
   122	      # GA alike. This token is the job's only credential; the job has no
   123	      # id-token and no environment.
